        "title": "Ai ninge tingsang lungpui ram",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai ninge tingsang lungpui ram,",
            "Tuai dat mak mei kachak dandi namdai 2!-;",
            "Neimik khang suang gan gai e tu e,",
            "Ai hou ni e hei namdai 2!- kaumei lungpui bam.",
            "",
            "2. Meinun kauh namdai njuan pui chang,",
            "Lai tatna tatman pukhang ai lunghgei;",
            "Pap phung bam khou rui pumtan maknga,",
            "Kauh kanan ramgai gundaimei houmak- khang rianra.",
            "",
            "3. Poubaumei bumang rui ramhma,",
            "Thou rui guangtang ngam nicho, kandih khou rui;",
            "Bumang man lou pui bam kandih e,",
            "Poubaumei ai lummei guaita simei rui kham e.",
            "",
            "4. Lummei guai mu tingkauh ram khou,",
            "Neimik khang suang gan gaina ganbam puni;",
            "Kandih khou rianra guai lou duna,",
            "Neilamei rui mun kum puang ni tuai dat pulak khe.",
            "",
            "5. Ai rui lung ni kauh namdai khou,",
            "Tingsagna jangthak puni hei namdai khou;",
            "Pou rui damloumei Salem namdai,",
            "Aniu kapumma hei lungni rianramei maknga."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
